hlumberger upladed files to interact. Production started to prepare unisolation of PWV and prepared for beaning up well.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-30T02:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-30T02:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3478</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Held toolbox talk prior to start beaning up the well.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-30T02:30:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-30T03:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3478</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Production completed unisolation plan of PWV. WHP 83 bar.</witsml:comments></witsml:activity><witsml:activity><witsml:dTimStart>2014-11-30T03:00:00+01:00</witsml:dTimStart><witsml:dTimEnd>2014-11-30T03:15:00+01:00</witsml:dTimEnd><witsml:md uom="m">3478</witsml:md><witsml:phase>wire line</witsml:phase><witsml:proprietaryCode>workover -- wire line</witsml:proprietaryCode><witsml:state>ok</witsml:state><witsml:stateDetailActivity>success</witsml:stateDetailActivity><witsml:comments>Equalized PWV using hose from KW over to production line. Opened PWV.
